	(87, 'Can you really make 20 to 50 pips per day in forex trading?', '<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">YES you can make 20-50 pips quite easily\r\nper day, and it is realistic. But don’t expect to just do one trade and get it\r\nright. You need to do a few trades and work on getting a net profit with your\r\npips. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">Check this weekly summary I sent to my\r\nfollowers last week – you will see we made some losses, and we had 54% accuracy\r\nfor that week, but we made a hell lot more in profit. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-GB">1370\r\npips / 5 days = 274 pips in a day!<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">Last Weeky Summary ::&nbsp; 30-May to 3-June 2022&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;\r\n----------------------------------------------------&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;\r\n**Total Trades :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 13&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;\r\nTotal Trades Reach Target :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n7&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;\r\nTotal Pips on Target :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n1370&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp; </span><span lang="EN-GB">🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥</span><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lan