n and accusing the police of bias&nbsp;in the protesters’ favor. Those incendiary remarks presented Sunak with a direct challenge to his authority, and left him with a call to make about her future in his government.<br>The departure of the most senior right-winger in his cabinet shows the electorate that the turmoil of this Conservative government is never far from the surface, belying Sunak’s efforts to distance himself from his predecessors after years of turbulent Tory rule.<br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="en-GB" style="language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="en-GB" style="language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="en-GB" style="language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><!--[if !mso]>\r\n<style>\r\nv\\:* {behavior:url(#default#VML);}\r\no\\:* {behavior:url(#default#VML);}\r\nb\\:* {behavior:url(#default#VML);}\r\n.shape {behavior:url(#default#VML);}\r\n</style>\r\n<![endif]--><!--[if pub]><xml>\r\n <b:Publication type="OplPub" oty="68" oh="256">\r\n  <b:OhPrintBlock priv="30E">281</b:OhPrintBlock>\r\n  <b:NuDefaultUnits priv="1004">1</b:NuDefaultUnits>\r\n  <b:DptlPageDimensions type="OplPt" priv="1211">\r\n   <b:Xl priv="104">7560000</b:Xl>\r\n   <b:Yl priv="204">10692000</b:Yl>\r\n  </b:DptlPageDimensions>\r\n  <b:DxlDefaultTab priv="1504">359410</b:DxlDefaultTab>\r\n  <b:OhGallery priv="180E">259</b:OhGallery>\r\n  <b:OhFancyBorders priv="190E">261</b:OhFancyBorders>\r\n  <b:OhCaptions priv="1A0E">257</b:OhCaptions>\r\n  <b:OhQuillDoc priv="200E">276</b:OhQuillDoc>\r\n  <b:OhMailMergeData priv="210E">262</b:OhMailMergeData>\r\n  <b:OhColorScheme priv="220E">279</b:OhColorScheme>\r\n  <b:DwNextUniqueOid priv="2304">1</b:DwNextUniqueOid>\r\n  <b:IdentGUID priv="2A07">0``````````````````````</b:IdentGUID>\r\n  <b:DpgSpecial pri